comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-29T15:17:13.352Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: complete all-status keyword searches found closed pm-q813 for package-manager run-script wrappers, pm-mlc3 for package-manager flag prefixes, and pm-ed28wi for merge-time command provenance/trust. None owns capability-equivalent command normalization or missing pm test help disclosure. This issue recurs from pm-q813, is an incident in the broader trust boundary, and was discovered during pm-vwuidf exact-head closeout."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-29T15:17:13.352Z","harness:codex","GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1154. Keep this item open and unclaimed until implementation is actively scheduled; PR #1149 only performs durable intake."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-29T15:17:13.352Z","harness:codex","String-token deny rules are not execution-capability boundaries: accepting sh -c around a refused command makes the bypass less inspectable than the direct form and creates counterproductive agent UX."
escape_class: production_defect
